# Every member of a real DirectAdmin 1.709 account backup, as tar lists
# them. Taken from the disposable account gzv0908a on the validation host
# on 2026-09-08; the domain is under .invalid and there is no customer
# data here. This is the evidence ADR 0019 question 6 was waiting for, and
# dabackup's member tables are checked against it.
#
# The account's own files are in three places, not one: domains/ has the
# websites, imap/ has the messages, and the rest of the home directory --
# the dotfiles and anything outside a domain -- is a second compressed
# archive at backup/home.tar.zst, listed in home.tar.list beside this.
